        // The only observable way to set allowed roles is impossible externally (allowedRoles is private).
        // But transfers require either sender or recipient to be allowed. To exercise that, we attempt to call transfer
        // from this contract (which currently has zero tokens) via transferFrom after approving allowances from sender.
        // To keep within observable API, we will use c.transfer and c.transferFrom and observe outcomes and balances.

        // Preconditions for trying transfer: make sure this test contract has enough Ether to potentially fund payable calls (not used)
        // No special precondition on contract's token state.

